# Work Log - 2026-11-10 21:20:00

## Scope & Objective
1. Built and integrated fluid 4-stage DPI pipeline animation (SVG + Canvas + CSS keyframes) into Capture view and Overview view.
2. Fixed React duplicate key collision warnings across streaming packets and flows.
3. Created an isolated Docker lab testing environment with 4 intentionally vulnerable containers (`vsftpd`, `openssh-server`, `dvwa`, `metasploitable-lite`) and multi-threaded `traffic_generator.py`.
4. Implemented non-blocking Reverse DNS (rDNS PTR) and passive DNS extraction in backend `dpi/server.py` and `feature_extractor.py`.
5. Exposed originating and destination site/source hostnames across Session Forensics, Flow Explorer, and Packet Inspector.

## Changes Made
- `dpi/feature/feature_extractor.py`:
  - Added DNS layer extraction (`dns.qry_name`, `dns.resp_name`) to `FeatureExtractor.extract()`.
  - Injected `dns_query` into packet features output.
- `dpi/server.py`:
  - Implemented `DNSResolver` class with `ThreadPoolExecutor` and in-memory LRU cache.
  - Added fast reverse DNS (rDNS PTR) with fallback for loopback, local LAN, and Docker bridge lab subnet (`172.30.0.10` -> `kgec-vuln-ftp.lab`, etc.).
  - Added `dns_resolver.learn_dns_mapping()` for passive learning from wire DNS traffic.
  - Attached `src_host`, `dst_host`, and `dns_name` to `packet_record` and `flow_summary`.
  - Added `GET /api/dns/resolve` endpoint for real-time IP lookup.
  - Updated `/api/session/report` to include `src_host`, `dst_host`, and `dns_name` for all flagged threat flows and top talkers.
- `apps/web/lib/api.ts`:
  - Added `src_host`, `dst_host`, `dns_name`, and `dns_query` to TypeScript interfaces `PacketRecord`, `FlowSummary`, and `SessionReport`.
  - Added `resolveDns()` client function.
- `apps/web/components/views/AnalyticsView.tsx`:
  - Added `Globe` icon badge displaying resolved host/site for Top Active Sources.
  - Added DNS Host/Site badge underneath source and destination endpoints in Flagged Threats table.
- `apps/web/components/views/FlowsView.tsx`:
  - Displayed inline `Globe` badge with resolved hostname on flow conversation rows.
  - Added "DNS & Host Identity" card to Deep Feature Inspector drawer showing originating site, target site, and DNS query.
- `apps/web/components/views/PacketsView.tsx`:
  - Added resolved hostname display for source and destination IPs in packet table.

